  "title": "Gluten-Free Pumpkin Cookies",
  "description": "These soft gluten-free pumpkin cookies, made with shredded coconut and loaded with flavorful fall spices like ginger, cloves, and nutmeg, make a decadent dessert treat.",
  "authors": [
